# Review package: ticket 02, 87c8823..5b42960

## Commits
### 5b42960
fix(state): wrap fill and copyWithin through the Proxy

A reactive array hands out the native fill and copyWithin, so each
element write wakes an every-index subscriber on its own. Add both
names to the mutating method set so they run in a batch and wake each
subscriber once after the call returns.

Cover wake counts, batches, bounds and frozen arrays on both kinds of
state, and add fill and copyWithin to the property-based array test.


